            </note>
            <note corresp="#d70-f2" n="2" xml:id="d70-f2-content">
                <p>The full text of the preliminary notes is <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, OCB
                    Files: Lot 62 D 430, Preliminary Notes.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d70-f3" n="3" xml:id="d70-f3-content">
                <p>Reference is to the OCB luncheon meeting of May 6. Preliminary notes of that
                    meeting are <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi></p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d70-f4" n="4" xml:id="d70-f4-content">
                <p>Reference is to telegram 2584 from Karachi, <ref target="#d69"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">supra</hi></ref>.</p>
